#, no-wrap
msgid "To earn your badge for Basics of quantum information, take the exam at IBM&reg; Training. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the lessons in this course. After you pass the exam, you will be notified by Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr "양자 정보의 기초 배지를 얻으려면 IBM&reg; Training에서 시험을 치르세요. 이 시험은 이 과정의 수업을 읽은 후에 치르도록 설계되었습니다. 시험에 합격하면 Credly로부터 배지를 획득했다는 알림을 받게 됩니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Exam](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information/exam)\n"
msgstr "[시험](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information/exam)\n"

